#: ../../source/changelog.rst:5
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "更新日志"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:8
msgid "v1.0.5 :bdg-success-line:`Latest`"
msgstr "v1.0.5 :bdg-success-line:`最新`"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:10 ../../source/changelog.rst:126
#: ../../source/changelog.rst:262 ../../source/changelog.rst:294
msgid "**Added**"
msgstr "**新增**"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:12
msgid ""
"Bundled 10 additional third-party Manim plugins as subpackages: "
"``arabic``, ``chemistry``, ``economics``, ``fontawesome``, "
"``machine_learning`` (ManimML), ``pymunk``, ``qr_codes``, "
"``svg_animations``, ``table``, and ``weighted_line`` — plus ``manim-"
"nerdfont-icons`` 1.0.2, vendored as ``manim_extensions.utils.nerdfont`` "
"because its PyPI metadata pins ``manim>=0.19,<0.20`` (code and font "
"licensed separately, font shipped as package data)."
msgstr "新增 10 个第三方 Manim 插件作为内置子包：``arabic``、``chemistry``、``economics``、``fontawesome``、``machine_learning``（ManimML）、``pymunk``、``qr_codes``、``svg_animations``、``table`` 和 ``weighted_line``——另有 ``manim-nerdfont-icons`` 1.0.2，因其 PyPI 元数据锁定 ``manim>=0.19,<0.20``，故以 ``manim_extensions.utils.nerdfont`` 形式内置（代码与字体分别授权，字体作为包数据分发）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:20
msgid ""
"Added API reference documentation for every bundled package, with a "
"single consolidated inheritance graph in the Reference Manual."
msgstr "为每个内置包新增 API 参考文档，并在参考手册中提供一张汇总的继承关系图。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:22
msgid ""
"Added a same-named optional extra for every module (``automata``, "
"``chemistry``, ``physics``, ``rubikscube``, ``meshes``, ``video``, "
"``qr``, ``svg``, ``ml``, ...) and an ``all`` extra; the base install is "
"now just ``manim`` + ``numpy``, and every heavier dependency is lazy-"
"imported via the new ``manim_extensions.utils.deps.require`` helper whose"
" error names the exact ``pip install manim_extensions[...]`` command. A "
"subprocess-based test blocks all optional packages via a meta-path finder"
" and asserts the base package and all 250+ submodules still import."
msgstr "为每个模块新增同名可选 extra（``automata``、``chemistry``、``physics``、``rubikscube``、``meshes``、``video``、``qr``、``svg``、``ml``……）以及一个 ``all`` extra；基础安装现在只需要 ``manim`` + ``numpy``，所有较重的依赖都通过新的 ``manim_extensions.utils.deps.require`` 辅助函数惰性导入，其报错信息会给出确切的 ``pip install manim_extensions[...]`` 命令。新增一个基于子进程的测试，通过 meta-path finder 屏蔽所有可选包，断言基础包和全部 250+ 个子模块仍可导入。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:31
msgid ""
"Added ``VENDORED.md``: a registry of every vendored package's upstream "
"repository, sync version, and local patches (also marked in-file with ``#"
" patched:`` header lines)."
msgstr "新增 ``VENDORED.md``：登记每个内置包的上游仓库、同步版本和本地补丁（文件中同时以 ``# patched:`` 头行标注）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:34
msgid ""
"Added comprehensive pytest coverage for previously untested modules (the "
"suite grows from 331 to 421 tests), including import-resolution "
"regressions, optional-dependency guards, and per-module behaviour."
msgstr "为此前未覆盖的模块补充了全面的 pytest 测试（测试套件从 331 个增长到 421 个），包括导入解析回归、可选依赖守卫和各模块行为。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:37
msgid ""
"Added CI: a ``manim-latest`` job that upgrades to the newest manim "
"release and runs the full suite (turning ``manim>=0.21.0`` from a claim "
"into a tested guarantee); a ``docs-media`` workflow that pre-renders "
"every doc example at high quality into the ``rtd-media`` branch (content-"
"hash incremental, pytest-style progress output) so Read the Docs reuses "
"the media instead of timing out; and an RTD API trigger that also builds "
"tagged versions after syncing them."
msgstr "新增 CI：``manim-latest`` 作业会升级到最新的 manim 版本并运行完整测试套件（让 ``manim>=0.21.0`` 从口头声明变成经过测试的保证）；``docs-media`` 工作流以高质量预渲染所有文档示例并存入 ``rtd-media`` 分支（按内容哈希增量渲染，pytest 风格进度输出），使 Read the Docs 复用媒体文件而不至于超时；还有一个 RTD API 触发器，在同步标签版本后一并构建它们。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:44
msgid ""
"Added ``workflow/check_relative_imports.py`` and ``validate-relative-"
"imports`` / ``validate-docstrings`` / ``validate-refs`` jobs to the "
"Validate workflow."
msgstr "新增 ``workflow/check_relative_imports.py``，并在 Validate 工作流中加入 ``validate-relative-imports`` / ``validate-docstrings`` / ``validate-refs`` 作业。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:47
msgid ""
"Added full type annotations to every function and method parameter across"
" the entire codebase (544+ functions in 128 files, ~1286 annotations), "
"plus a ``validate-type-annotations`` CI job "
"(``scripts/check_type_annotations.py``) to enforce the requirement going "
"forward."
msgstr "为整个代码库的每个函数和方法参数补齐了完整类型标注（128 个文件中的 544+ 个函数，约 1286 处标注），并新增 ``validate-type-annotations`` CI 作业（``scripts/check_type_annotations.py``）以在今后强制执行该要求。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:52
msgid "Added rounded-corner static cover images to the README."
msgstr "为 README 新增圆角静态封面图。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:54 ../../source/changelog.rst:141
#: ../../source/changelog.rst:269 ../../source/changelog.rst:280
msgid "**Changed**"
msgstr "**变更**"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:56
msgid ""
"Raised the minimum Manim version from ``>=0.19.1`` to ``>=0.21.0`` and "
"migrated the ``table`` module from ``manimlib`` (ManimGL) to Manim "
"Community Edition."
msgstr "最低 Manim 版本从 ``>=0.19.1`` 提升到 ``>=0.21.0``，并将 ``table`` 模块从 ``manimlib`` （ManimGL）迁移到 Manim 社区版。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:59
msgid ""
"Replaced the type-specific geometry intersection helpers with a single "
"generic ``VMobjectInt``."
msgstr "用单一的通用 ``VMobjectInt`` 取代了按类型区分的几何求交辅助函数。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:61
msgid ""
"Converted all intra-package absolute imports to relative imports, and "
"banned ``from manim import *`` outside ``__init__.py`` across the whole "
"repository (165 files converted to explicit imports; the import-style "
"checker was inverted accordingly). This also surfaced and fixed real "
"latent bugs that star imports had masked from pyflakes (see Fixed)."
msgstr "将包内所有绝对导入改为相对导入，并在全仓库范围内禁止在 ``__init__.py`` 之外使用 ``from manim import *`` （165 个文件改为显式导入；导入风格检查器也相应反转）。这一过程还暴露并修复了被星号导入掩盖、pyflakes 无法发现的真实潜在 bug（见“修复”）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:66
msgid ""
"Converted all Google-style ``Args:`` docstring sections to numpydoc "
"``Parameters`` (64 sections across 16 files) and added a ``--fix`` mode "
"to the docstring validator to keep it that way."
msgstr "将所有 Google 风格的 ``Args:`` 文档字符串段落转换为 numpydoc 的 ``Parameters``（16 个文件共 64 段），并为文档字符串校验器新增 ``--fix`` 模式以保持规范。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Normalised indexed labels in doc examples to LaTeX subscripts (``V0`` → "
"``V_0``, ``ext{A1}`` → ``ext{A}_1``, ``P{i+1}`` → ``P_{i+1}``)."
msgstr "将文档示例中的带下标标签统一为 LaTeX 下标（``V0`` → ``V_0``，``ext{A1}`` → ``ext{A}_1``，``P{i+1}`` → ``P_{i+1}``）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:72
msgid ""
"Reworked the docs build: examples are pre-rendered by CI and reused on "
"RTD via a media cache; README cover media switched from GIFs to three "
"rounded static images; ``conf.py`` version synced to 1.0.5 and the "
"changelog gained a sphinx-design ``Latest`` badge."
msgstr "重构文档构建：示例由 CI 预渲染并通过媒体缓存供 RTD 复用；README 封面媒体从 GIF 换成三张圆角静态图；``conf.py`` 版本同步到 1.0.5，更新日志新增 sphinx-design 的 ``Latest`` 徽章。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:76
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` doc examples now "
"use the default realistic colour scheme instead of an ad-hoc palette."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 的文档示例现在使用默认的写实配色方案，而不是临时拼凑的调色板。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:79 ../../source/changelog.rst:190
#: ../../source/changelog.rst:273 ../../source/changelog.rst:287
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**修复**"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:81
msgid ""
"Fixed ``qr_codes/__init__.py`` importing a nonexistent ``QRCode`` class "
"and the root ``__init__.py`` importing a nonexistent ``ml`` module — both"
" broke ``import manim_extensions``."
msgstr "修复 ``qr_codes/__init__.py`` 导入不存在的 ``QRCode`` 类、根 ``__init__.py`` 导入不存在的 ``ml`` 模块的问题——两者都会导致 ``import manim_extensions`` 失败。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:84
msgid ""
"Fixed manim's ``utils`` namespace shadowing the package's own utils "
"submodules."
msgstr "修复 manim 的 ``utils`` 命名空间遮蔽本包 utils 子模块的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:86
msgid ""
"Fixed machine-learning empty-animation groups being unplayable on manim "
">= 0.21, and the pymunk 7 collision-API / "
":class:`~manim_extensions.economics.base.ADASDiagram` ``numbered_eq`` "
"regressions."
msgstr "修复机器学习空动画组在 manim >= 0.21 上无法播放的问题，以及 pymunk 7 碰撞 API / :class:`~manim_extensions.economics.base.ADASDiagram` 的 ``numbered_eq`` 回归。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:90
msgid ""
"Fixed :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube_animations.CubeMove` face"
" turns being strictly linear: manim 0.21 expects subclasses to apply "
"``rate_func`` themselves, so the rotation now eases in and out like the "
"original ManimGL version."
msgstr "修复 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube_animations.CubeMove` 转面严格线性运动的问题：manim 0.21 要求子类自行应用 ``rate_func``，现在旋转会像最初的 ManimGL 版本一样缓入缓出。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:93
msgid ""
"Fixed the Arabic module failing on every non-macOS platform: the macOS-"
"only ``Al Bayan`` default is replaced by fontconfig-based auto-resolution"
" (Amiri/Scheherazade/Noto Naskh Arabic...)."
msgstr "修复阿拉伯语模块在非 macOS 平台上全部失败的问题：仅 macOS 可用的 ``Al Bayan`` 默认字体被替换为基于 fontconfig 的自动解析（Amiri/Scheherazade/Noto Naskh Arabic……）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:96
msgid ""
"Latent undefined-name bugs surfaced by removing star imports: "
":class:`~manim_extensions.machine_learning.neural_network.layers.parent_layers.NeuralNetworkLayer`"
" quoted annotations now import the real base class; ``leaf_child_index`` "
"typo; dead code after ``raise NotImplementedError()``; an undefined "
"``transition_ids`` in the nondeterministic-automata path; missing "
"``functools.wraps``, ``plt``, ``manim_version``, and ``svg2paths`` "
"imports."
msgstr "移除星号导入后暴露的潜在未定义名称 bug：:class:`~manim_extensions.machine_learning.neural_network.layers.parent_layers.NeuralNetworkLayer` 的引号注解现在导入真实的基类；``leaf_child_index`` 拼写错误；``raise NotImplementedError()`` 之后的死代码；非确定性自动机路径中未定义的 ``transition_ids``；缺失的 ``functools.wraps``、``plt``、``manim_version`` 和 ``svg2paths`` 导入。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:103
msgid ""
"Fixed the wheel silently dropping runtime data files (mesh shaders, Font "
"Awesome SVGs, compass assets, the Nerd Font TTF, REUSE sidecars), which "
"broke non-editable installs."
msgstr "修复 wheel 静默丢失运行时数据文件（网格着色器、Font Awesome SVG、圆规素材、Nerd Font TTF、REUSE 附属文件）导致非可编辑安装失效的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:106
msgid "Repaired mojibake characters in ``mesh.py`` and ``manim_directive.py``."
msgstr "修复 ``mesh.py`` 和 ``manim_directive.py`` 中的乱码字符。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:107
msgid ""
"Fixed CI authentication and incremental seeding for the docs-media "
"workflow, and made tests skip gracefully when optional extras "
"(``sklearn``, the ``manim-mobject-svg`` plugin on Python 3.13+) are "
"absent."
msgstr "修复 docs-media 工作流的 CI 认证与增量种子问题，并让测试在缺少可选 extras（``sklearn``、Python 3.13+ 上的 ``manim-mobject-svg`` 插件）时优雅跳过。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:111
msgid ""
"Fixed the gearbox module failing to import due to an incorrect "
"``Renderer`` type annotation on the radius parameter of "
":func:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.gear_mobjects.gear_mobject.involute_func`"
" and related functions."
msgstr "修复 :func:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.gear_mobjects.gear_mobject.involute_func` 及相关函数的 radius 参数上错误的 ``Renderer`` 类型标注导致 gearbox 模块无法导入的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:115
msgid ""
"Fixed missing closing parentheses in four docstring manim example blocks "
"(MCMCAxes, MultiPendulum, GMAnimationBuilder, VMobjectInt) that caused "
"the docs-media render workflow to fail."
msgstr "修复四个文档字符串 manim 示例块（MCMCAxes、MultiPendulum、GMAnimationBuilder、VMobjectInt）中缺失的右括号，该问题曾导致 docs-media 渲染工作流失败。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:118
msgid ""
"Fixed misplaced type annotations that caused ``NameError`` in five files "
"(algorithm/array.py, chemistry/utils/utils.py, "
"chemistry/manim_chemistry_molecule/mc_atom.py, "
"chemistry/twoD/molecule.py, circuit/mobjects.py)."
msgstr "修复五个文件（algorithm/array.py、chemistry/utils/utils.py、chemistry/manim_chemistry_molecule/mc_atom.py、chemistry/twoD/molecule.py、circuit/mobjects.py）中位置错误导致 ``NameError`` 的类型标注。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:124
msgid "v1.0.4"
msgstr "v1.0.4"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:128
msgid ""
"Added ``ArcInt`` to the Basic geometry module and its documentation in "
"``geometry.rst`` for computing arc-arc intersections."
msgstr "在核心几何模块中新增 ``ArcInt`` 及其在 ``geometry.rst`` 中的文档，用于计算圆弧与圆弧的交点。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:130
msgid ""
"Added ``reuse-lint`` and ``flake8-unused-imports`` jobs to the GitHub "
"Actions workflow for license compliance and unused import detection."
msgstr "在 GitHub Actions 工作流中新增 ``reuse-lint`` 和 ``flake8-unused-imports`` 作业，用于许可证合规与未使用导入检测。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:132
msgid ""
"Added custom Sphinx extension ``inheritance_colors`` that color-codes "
"inheritance diagram nodes by module origin — Manim nodes in green "
"(#87C2A5), Manim Extensions nodes in teal (#4DB8D4), with dark foreground"
" (#1E1E2E) for both, and uncolored Python nodes in gray — with a dynamic "
"legend auto-generated above each diagram."
msgstr "新增自定义 Sphinx 扩展 ``inheritance_colors``，按模块来源为继承图节点着色——Manim 节点为绿色（#87C2A5），Manim Extensions 节点为青色（#4DB8D4），两者均使用深色前景（#1E1E2E），未着色的 Python 节点为灰色——并在每张图上方自动生成动态图例。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:137
msgid ""
"Added legend display above inheritance diagrams with color swatches for "
"Manim, Manim Extensions, and Python (auto-detected when third-party nodes"
" appear in a diagram)."
msgstr "在继承图上方新增图例显示，包含 Manim、Manim Extensions 和 Python 的色块（当图中出现第三方节点时自动检测）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:143
msgid ""
"Replaced all ``YELLOW`` color references with ``PURE_YELLOW`` (#FFFF00) "
"across the entire codebase (58 occurrences, 20 files), matching the "
"original bright yellow that Manim's ``YELLOW`` constant used to "
"represent."
msgstr "在整个代码库（20 个文件共 58 处）中将所有 ``YELLOW`` 颜色引用替换为 ``PURE_YELLOW``（#FFFF00），与 Manim 的 ``YELLOW`` 常量原本代表的亮黄色一致。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:146
msgid ""
"Simplified :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ExtendedLine` by removing "
"the ``**kwargs`` parameter — the class now automatically copies the "
"source line's style via ``match_style()``; updated the docstring to "
"document this behavior."
msgstr "简化 :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ExtendedLine`，移除 ``**kwargs`` 参数——该类现在通过 ``match_style()`` 自动复制源线段的样式；文档字符串已更新以说明此行为。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:149
msgid ""
"Removed all ``.. inheritance-diagram::`` directives from ``mobjects.py`` "
"docstrings (previously present for 11 classes)."
msgstr "移除 ``mobjects.py`` 文档字符串中的所有 ``.. inheritance-diagram::`` 指令（此前有 11 个类带有该指令）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:151
msgid ""
"Updated documentation logo size to 208px width (matching Manim Community "
"docs)."
msgstr "将文档 logo 尺寸更新为 208px 宽（与 Manim 社区文档一致）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:152
msgid ""
"Updated documentation: added per-module index pages with individual "
"``:doc:`` links in the main index (matching the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.compass.compass.compass.Compass` style), added "
"inheritance diagrams for all bundled modules, and removed references to "
"the deleted ``third_party/`` directory and Git submodules."
msgstr "更新文档：为各模块新增索引页并在主索引中加入单独的 ``:doc:`` 链接（与 :class:`~manim_extensions.compass.compass.compass.Compass` 风格一致），为所有内置模块添加继承图，并移除对已删除的 ``third_party/`` 目录和 Git 子模块的引用。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:156
msgid ""
"Updated Python version requirement to ``>=3.11`` across "
"``pyproject.toml``, GitHub Actions workflow, and documentation."
msgstr "将 Python 版本要求更新为 ``>=3.11``，涉及 ``pyproject.toml``、GitHub Actions 工作流和文档。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:158
msgid ""
"Added comprehensive parameter documentation (``Parameters`` sections) to "
"all public classes across ``algorithm``, ``circuit``, ``compass``, "
"``meshes``, ``mindmap``, ``physics``, and ``rubikscube`` modules, "
"documenting every ``__init__`` parameter in class-level docstrings."
msgstr "为 ``algorithm``、``circuit``、``compass``、``meshes``、``mindmap``、``physics`` 和 ``rubikscube`` 模块的所有公开类补充了完整的参数文档（``Parameters`` 段落），在类级文档字符串中记录每个 ``__init__`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:162
msgid ""
"Added ``validate.yml`` GitHub Actions workflow with three separate jobs "
"(``validate-manim-directives``, ``validate-param-docs``, ``validate-"
"refs``) and their corresponding Python validation scripts."
msgstr "新增 ``validate.yml`` GitHub Actions 工作流，包含三个独立作业（``validate-manim-directives``、``validate-param-docs``、``validate-refs``）及对应的 Python 校验脚本。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:165
msgid ""
"Removed module-level ``.. manim::`` directive examples from 16 Python "
"files (the rendering engine does not display module-level manim "
"examples)."
msgstr "从 16 个 Python 文件中移除模块级的 ``.. manim::`` 指令示例（渲染引擎不会显示模块级的 manim 示例）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:167
msgid ""
"Converted all absolute ``from manim_extensions.xxx`` imports to relative "
"imports across 12 files in ``meshes/`` and ``algorithm/`` subpackages "
"(``params.py``, ``templates.py``, ``helpers.py``, ``basic_mesh.py``, "
"``opengl_mesh.py``, ``triangle_mesh.py``, ``mesh.py``, ``voronoi.py``, "
"``divide_and_conquer.py``, ``delaunay_criterion.py``, ``array.py``, "
"``test_numpy_helper.py``) to follow PEP 8 and reduce coupling."
msgstr "将 ``meshes/`` 和 ``algorithm/`` 子包中 12 个文件（``params.py``、``templates.py``、``helpers.py``、``basic_mesh.py``、``opengl_mesh.py``、``triangle_mesh.py``、``mesh.py``、``voronoi.py``、``divide_and_conquer.py``、``delaunay_criterion.py``、``array.py``、``test_numpy_helper.py``）的所有 ``from manim_extensions.xxx`` 绝对导入改为相对导入，以遵循 PEP 8 并降低耦合。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:173
msgid ""
"Added ``package_data`` configuration in ``pyproject.toml`` to ensure mesh"
" model data files (``*.ply``, ``*.stl``) are included in ``sdist`` and "
"``wheel`` distributions."
msgstr "在 ``pyproject.toml`` 中新增 ``package_data`` 配置，确保网格模型数据文件（``*.ply``、``*.stl``）包含在 ``sdist`` 和 ``wheel`` 发行包中。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:176
msgid ""
"Added minimum version constraints to all third-party dependencies in "
"``pyproject.toml`` — most importantly ``shapely>=2.0`` (required for the "
"new ``from shapely import geometry`` API used in optics), plus "
"``Pillow>=9.0``, ``opencv-python>=4.5``, ``pymunk>=6.0``, "
"``kociemba>=1.2``, ``trimesh>=4.0``, ``scipy>=1.9``, and "
"``moderngl>=5.0``."
msgstr "为 ``pyproject.toml`` 中所有第三方依赖添加最低版本约束——最重要的是 ``shapely>=2.0``（光学模块使用的新 ``from shapely import geometry`` API 所需），此外还有 ``Pillow>=9.0``、``opencv-python>=4.5``、``pymunk>=6.0``、``kociemba>=1.2``、``trimesh>=4.0``、``scipy>=1.9`` 和 ``moderngl>=5.0``。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:183
msgid "**Removed**"
msgstr "**移除**"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:185
msgid ""
"Deleted :class:`~manim.mobject.text.code_mobject.Code`, ``JavaCode``, "
"``PythonCode``, and ``CppCode`` classes from the ``algorithm`` module "
"(unused code block classes)."
msgstr "从 ``algorithm`` 模块中删除 :class:`~manim.mobject.text.code_mobject.Code`、``JavaCode``、``PythonCode`` 和 ``CppCode`` 类（未使用的代码块类）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:187
msgid ""
"Removed the ``index_code_labels`` helper from "
"``algorithm/utils/debug.py`` (was only used by the deleted "
":class:`~manim.mobject.text.code_mobject.Code` class)."
msgstr "从 ``algorithm/utils/debug.py`` 中移除 ``index_code_labels`` 辅助函数（仅被已删除的 :class:`~manim.mobject.text.code_mobject.Code` 类使用）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:192
msgid ""
"Fixed "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_transition.ManimTransitionDocExample`"
" displaying a full DFA instead of demonstrating a single transition."
msgstr "修复 :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_transition.ManimTransitionDocExample` 展示整个 DFA 而非演示单次转移的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:194
msgid ""
"Fixed ``KeyError: 'pop'`` and ``KeyError: 'push'`` in "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_pushdown_automaton.ManimPushDownAutomaton`"
" and "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_pushdown_automaton.ManimPushDownAutomatonTransition`"
" by adding PDA-specific default templates and defensive ``.get()`` "
"lookups."
msgstr "通过添加 PDA 专用的默认模板和防御性的 ``.get()`` 查找，修复 :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_pushdown_automaton.ManimPushDownAutomaton` 和 :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_pushdown_automaton.ManimPushDownAutomatonTransition` 中的 ``KeyError: 'pop'`` 与 ``KeyError: 'push'``。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:198
msgid ""
"Fixed GitHub Actions workflow paths for ``validate_param_docs.py`` and "
"``validate_directives.py`` (added ``workflow/`` prefix)."
msgstr "修复 ``validate_param_docs.py`` 和 ``validate_directives.py`` 在 GitHub Actions 工作流中的路径（补充 ``workflow/`` 前缀）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:200
msgid ""
"Fixed Sphinx cross-references in ``circuit`` and ``mindmap`` modules "
"(:attr:`~manim.constants.LEFT`, :attr:`~manim.constants.DOWN`, and "
":attr:`~manim_extensions.mindmap.algorithms.layout_config.LayoutDirection.LeftToRight`"
" inline code to proper ``:class:``/``:attr:`` cross-references)."
msgstr "修复 ``circuit`` 和 ``mindmap`` 模块中的 Sphinx 交叉引用（将 :attr:`~manim.constants.LEFT`、:attr:`~manim.constants.DOWN` 和 :attr:`~manim_extensions.mindmap.algorithms.layout_config.LayoutDirection.LeftToRight` 的行内代码改为规范的 ``:class:``/``:attr:`` 交叉引用）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:203
msgid ""
"Fixed CI test failures for missing ``xmltodict``, invalid escape "
"sequences in TikZ docstrings, and CJK font detection on Linux."
msgstr "修复因缺少 ``xmltodict``、TikZ 文档字符串中的非法转义序列以及 Linux 上 CJK 字体检测导致的 CI 测试失败。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:205
msgid ""
"Fixed ``TypeError`` for ``str | None`` union syntax in Python 3.10–3.13 "
"environments by adding ``from __future__ import annotations``."
msgstr "通过添加 ``from __future__ import annotations``，修复 ``str | None`` 联合类型语法在 Python 3.10–3.13 环境中的 ``TypeError``。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:207
msgid ""
"Fixed ``ArcInt`` division-by-zero error for concentric circles by adding "
"a ``d <= 1e-9`` guard."
msgstr "通过添加 ``d <= 1e-9`` 守卫，修复 ``ArcInt`` 对同心圆的除零错误。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:209
msgid ""
"Fixed "
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.opengl_mesh.FastManimMesh`"
" ``AttributeError`` by initialising ``triangle_indices`` before "
"``super().__init__()``."
msgstr "通过在 ``super().__init__()`` 之前初始化 ``triangle_indices``，修复 :class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.opengl_mesh.FastManimMesh` 的 ``AttributeError``。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:211
msgid ""
"Fixed Example Gallery frame overflow and centering for multiple examples "
"(``CircuitExample``, ``GearboxExample``, ``NeuralNetworkExample``, etc.) "
"by adjusting scales, shifts, and using ``scale_to_fit_width()``."
msgstr "通过调整缩放、平移并使用 ``scale_to_fit_width()``，修复示例画廊中多个示例（``CircuitExample``、``GearboxExample``、``NeuralNetworkExample`` 等）的画面溢出与居中问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:214
msgid ""
"Removed gray text / titles from "
":class:`~manim_extensions.compass.scene.compass_scene.CompassExample` and"
" ensured all geometry elements are centered."
msgstr "移除 :class:`~manim_extensions.compass.scene.compass_scene.CompassExample` 中的灰色文字/标题，并确保所有几何元素居中。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:216
msgid ""
"Fixed ``check_redundant_imports.py`` false positives: no longer flags "
"explicitly-imported names (e.g. "
":class:`~manim.mobject.opengl.opengl_compatibility.ConvertToOpenGL`) when"
" ``from manim import *`` is absent and those names are not covered by "
"star exports."
msgstr "修复 ``check_redundant_imports.py`` 的误报：当不存在 ``from manim import *`` 且相关名称不在星号导出范围内时，不再标记显式导入的名称（例如 :class:`~manim.mobject.opengl.opengl_compatibility.ConvertToOpenGL`）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:219
msgid ""
"Fixed ``validate_refs.py`` false positives: separated project class map "
"(``manim_extensions``) from installed ``manim`` so that manim-internal "
"names like :class:`~manim.mobject.text.code_mobject.Code` no longer "
"trigger inline-code suggestions in changelog/docs."
msgstr "修复 ``validate_refs.py`` 的误报：将项目类映射（``manim_extensions``）与已安装的 ``manim`` 分开，使 :class:`~manim.mobject.text.code_mobject.Code` 这类 manim 内部名称不再在更新日志/文档中触发行内代码建议。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:222
msgid ""
"Fixed ``flake8-unused-imports`` CI job by correcting the ``--exclude`` "
"glob pattern (``*__init__.py*``) so that all ``__init__.py`` files are "
"properly excluded from the F401 check."
msgstr "通过修正 ``--exclude`` 的 glob 模式（``*__init__.py*``），修复 ``flake8-unused-imports`` CI 作业，使所有 ``__init__.py`` 文件被正确排除在 F401 检查之外。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:225
msgid ""
"Added SPDX license header to ``CONTRIBUTING.md`` to restore REUSE 3.3 "
"compliance."
msgstr "为 ``CONTRIBUTING.md`` 添加 SPDX 许可证头，恢复 REUSE 3.3 合规。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:227
msgid ""
"Fixed ``pyproject.toml`` TOML parse error on Python 3.13 / pip by "
"replacing an invalid tuple (``(...)``) with an array (``[...]``) in the "
"``[tool.flake8]`` section."
msgstr "将 ``[tool.flake8]`` 段中的非法元组（``(...)``）替换为数组（``[...]``），修复 ``pyproject.toml`` 在 Python 3.13 / pip 上的 TOML 解析错误。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:230
msgid ""
"Added ``myst-parser`` to the ``docs`` optional dependencies so "
"ReadTheDocs can build the documentation with the included "
"``CONTRIBUTING.md``."
msgstr "将 ``myst-parser`` 加入 ``docs`` 可选依赖，使 ReadTheDocs 能构建包含 ``CONTRIBUTING.md`` 的文档。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:232
msgid ""
"Fixed :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.FileTree` box-drawing characters"
" not connecting on Linux / ReadTheDocs by switching the Linux fallback "
"font from ``DejaVu Sans Mono`` to ``JetBrains Mono``, and installing "
"``fonts-jetbrains-mono`` in the ReadTheDocs build environment."
msgstr "通过将 Linux 回退字体从 ``DejaVu Sans Mono`` 换成 ``JetBrains Mono``，并在 ReadTheDocs 构建环境中安装 ``fonts-jetbrains-mono``，修复 :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.FileTree` 制表符在 Linux / ReadTheDocs 上无法连接的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:236
msgid ""
"Fixed ``validate_refs.py`` false positives for filenames like "
"``CONTRIBUTING.md`` by skipping tokens ending in common file extensions "
"(``.md``, ``.rst``, ``.py``, etc.)."
msgstr "通过跳过以常见文件扩展名（``.md``、``.rst``、``.py`` 等）结尾的记号，修复 ``validate_refs.py`` 对 ``CONTRIBUTING.md`` 这类文件名的误报。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:239
msgid ""
"Fixed inheritance diagram node colors being overwritten / flashing on "
"page load by updating ``responsiveSvg.js`` to preserve custom fill colors"
" injected by the ``inheritance_colors`` extension."
msgstr "通过更新 ``responsiveSvg.js`` 以保留 ``inheritance_colors`` 扩展注入的自定义填充色，修复继承图节点颜色在页面加载时被覆盖/闪烁的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:242
msgid ""
"Fixed missing module exports in ``automata/__init__.py`` and "
"``automata/mobjects/__init__.py`` — added "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_turing_machine.ManimTuringMachine`,"
" :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_state.ManimState`, "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_transition.ManimTransition`,"
" "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_pushdown_automaton_transition.ManimPushDownAutomatonTransition`,"
" "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_automaton_input.ManimAutomataInput`,"
" :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.token.Token`, and "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.pushdown_automaton_rule.PushDownAutomatonRule`"
" to ``__all__`` so they are importable via ``from "
"manim_extensions.automata import ...``."
msgstr "修复 ``automata/__init__.py`` 和 ``automata/mobjects/__init__.py`` 中缺失的模块导出——将 :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_turing_machine.ManimTuringMachine`、:class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_state.ManimState`、:class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_transition.ManimTransition`、:class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_pushdown_automaton_transition.ManimPushDownAutomatonTransition`、:class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_automaton_input.ManimAutomataInput`、:class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.token.Token` 和 :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.pushdown_automaton_rule.PushDownAutomatonRule` 加入 ``__all__``，使其可以通过 ``from manim_extensions.automata import ...`` 导入。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:252
msgid ""
"Fixed Sphinx \"Title underline too short\" warnings in "
"``docs/source/reference/automata/mobjects.rst`` by extending underlines "
"for "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_transition.ManimTransition`,"
" "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_deterministic_finite_automaton.ManimdeterministicFiniteAutomaton`,"
" and "
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_nondeterministic_finite_automaton.ManimNondeterministicFiniteAutomaton`"
" headings."
msgstr "通过加长 :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_transition.ManimTransition`、:class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_deterministic_finite_automaton.ManimdeterministicFiniteAutomaton` 和 :class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_nondeterministic_finite_automaton.ManimNondeterministicFiniteAutomaton` 标题的下划线，修复 ``docs/source/reference/automata/mobjects.rst`` 中 Sphinx 的“标题下划线过短”警告。"

