#: ../../source/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"**manim_extensions** is an extension toolkit for `Manim Community "
"<https://www.manim.community/>`_, providing extra mobjects, geometric "
"utilities, animation effects, and curated third-party plugins to help you"
" create mathematical animations more efficiently."
msgstr "**manim_extensions** 是 `Manim 社区版 <https://www.manim.community/>`_ 的扩展工具包，提供额外的 mobject、几何工具、动画效果以及精选的第三方插件，帮助你更高效地制作数学动画。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:15
msgid "What is in this package?"
msgstr "这个包里有什么？"

#: ../../source/index.rst:17
msgid "The library is organised into two areas:"
msgstr "本库分为两个部分："

#: ../../source/index.rst:19
msgid "**Core extensions** (``manim_extensions``)"
msgstr "**核心扩展** （``manim_extensions``）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20
msgid "Additional mobjects and helpers built directly on top of Manim:"
msgstr "直接基于 Manim 构建的额外 mobject 与辅助工具："

#: ../../source/index.rst:22
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex` – Chinese-aware LaTeX "
"rendering with ``xeCJK``."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex` – 基于 ``xeCJK`` 的中文感知 LaTeX 渲染。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:24
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.LabelDot`, "
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.MathTexLine`, "
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.MathTexBrace`, "
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.MathTexDoublearrow` – annotated "
"geometric primitives."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.LabelDot`、:class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.MathTexLine`、:class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.MathTexBrace`、:class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.MathTexDoublearrow` – 带标注的几何图元。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ExtendedLine`, "
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.PerpendicularLine`, "
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.PerpendicularSign` – construction-"
"style line helpers."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ExtendedLine`、:class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.PerpendicularLine`、:class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.PerpendicularSign` – 尺规作图风格的线条辅助工具。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:33
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.FileTree` – ASCII file-tree rendering "
"from a nested dictionary."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.FileTree` – 从嵌套字典渲染 ASCII 文件树。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.CropImageMobject` – image mobject with"
" rounded-corner cropping via an alpha mask."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.CropImageMobject` – 通过 alpha 蒙版实现圆角裁剪的图像 mobject。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:37
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.VideoMobject` – video playback mobject"
" built on OpenCV."
