#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:5
#: ../../source/tutorials/quickstart.rst:11
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:8
msgid "Stable release"
msgstr "稳定版本"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"This installs Manim Community Edition (>=0.21), numpy, and — on Python < "
"3.13 — the ``manim-mobject-svg`` plugin. Everything else ships with manim"
" itself or is split into the per-module extras below and lazy-imported on"
" use."
msgstr "这会安装 Manim 社区版（>=0.21）、numpy，以及——在 Python < 3.13 上——``manim-mobject-svg`` 插件。其余组件要么随 manim 本体附带，要么拆分到下方按模块划分的 extras 中，在使用时惰性导入。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:22
msgid "Optional extras"
msgstr "可选 extras"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"Some functionality requires additional packages that are not installed by"
" default:"
msgstr "部分功能需要默认不安装的额外软件包："

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"If a feature is used without its extra installed, the error message names"
" the exact ``pip install manim_extensions[...]`` command."
msgstr "如果在未安装对应 extra 的情况下使用某项功能，报错信息会给出确切的 ``pip install manim_extensions[...]`` 命令。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:45
msgid ""
"Every vendored module also has a same-named extra. The ones below declare"
" no additional dependencies (they work with the base install) but exist "
"so installs can uniformly request ``manim_extensions[<module>]``: "
"``algorithm``, ``arabic``, ``circuit``, ``compass``, ``data_structures``,"
" ``economics``, ``fontawesome``, ``gearbox``, ``mindmap``, "
"``sequence_diagram``, ``table``, ``tikz``, ``weighted_line``."
msgstr "每个内置模块都有一个同名 extra。下面这些不声明额外依赖（基础安装即可使用），存在它们是为了让安装时可以统一地请求 ``manim_extensions[<module>]``：``algorithm``、``arabic``、``circuit``、``compass``、``data_structures``、``economics``、``fontawesome``、``gearbox``、``mindmap``、``sequence_diagram``、``table``、``tikz``、``weighted_line``。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"One lazily-imported plugin is only partially declared in "
"``pyproject.toml`` because its PyPI metadata pins an incompatible Python "
"version:"
msgstr "有一个惰性导入的插件在 ``pyproject.toml`` 中只做了部分声明，因为它的 PyPI 元数据锁定了不兼容的 Python 版本："

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:57
msgid ""
"**manim-mobject-svg** (for "
":class:`~manim_extensions.svg_animations.HTMLParsedVMobject`) is "
"installed automatically on Python < 3.13; on Python 3.13+ install it with"
" ``pip install --ignore-requires-python manim-mobject-svg``."
msgstr "**manim-mobject-svg** （用于 :class:`~manim_extensions.svg_animations.HTMLParsedVMobject`）在 Python < 3.13 上会自动安装；在 Python 3.13+ 上请使用 ``pip install --ignore-requires-python manim-mobject-svg`` 安装。"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:62
msgid "Verifying the installation"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:64
msgid "After installation, import the package in Python:"
msgstr "安装完成后，在 Python 中导入该包："

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:71
msgid "You can also run the test suite locally:"
msgstr "你也可以在本地运行测试套件："

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:79
msgid "Development install"
msgstr "开发模式安装"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:81
