"To work on ``manim_extensions`` itself, clone the repository and install "
"in editable mode:"
msgstr "如果要开发 ``manim_extensions`` 本身，请克隆仓库并以可编辑模式安装："

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:90
msgid "The bundled plugins are included directly as Python subpackages."
msgstr "内置插件以 Python 子包的形式直接包含在内。"

