msgstr "LaTeX 要求"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:95
msgid ""
"If you want to use :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex`, "
"make sure ``xelatex`` and the ``xeCJK`` LaTeX package are available on "
"your system. For English-only formulas, Manim's default "
":class:`~manim.MathTex` works without additional LaTeX packages."
msgstr "如果你想使用 :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex`，请确保系统中有 ``xelatex`` 和 ``xeCJK`` LaTeX 宏包。对于纯英文公式，Manim 默认的 :class:`~manim.MathTex` 无需额外的 LaTeX 宏包即可使用。"

