#: ../../source/reference/automata/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"``manim-automata`` is a finite-state-machine toolkit for Manim. It is "
"designed for teaching automata, machine execution, and state transitions "
"in a clear, scene-ready format."
msgstr "``manim-automata`` 是面向 Manim 的有限状态机工具包。它专为教学场景设计，以清晰、可直接入场景的形式讲解自动机、机器执行过程和状态转移。"

#: ../../source/reference/automata/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.automata`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.automata`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/automata/index.rst:26
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.automata.mobjects.manim_automaton.ManimAutomaton`"
