#: ../../source/reference/basic/geometry.rst:6
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "几何"

#: ../../source/reference/basic/geometry.rst:10
msgid ""
"This module contains geometric calculation functions that operate "
"directly on Manim mobjects without creating any on-screen mobjects "
"themselves. :func:`~manim_extensions.geometry.VMobjectInt` works with "
"*any* two :class:`~manim.mobject.types.vectorized_mobject.VMobject` "
"instances — circles, lines, arcs, polygons, parametric curves, text, "
"groups, and so on — by intersecting their cubic Bézier outlines, so it "
"needs no special cases for particular mobject types.  They are useful for"
" analytic geometry tasks inside a :class:`~manim.scene.scene.Scene`."
msgstr "本模块包含直接作用于 Manim mobject 的几何计算函数，本身不创建任何屏幕上的 mobject。:func:`~manim_extensions.geometry.VMobjectInt` 通过对三次贝塞尔轮廓求交，适用于*任意*两个 :class:`~manim.mobject.types.vectorized_mobject.VMobject` 实例——圆、直线、圆弧、多边形、参数曲线、文本、组合等等——无需为特定 mobject 类型写特例。它们适用于 :class:`~manim.scene.scene.Scene` 中的解析几何任务。"

