#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/cli.rst:5
#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:72
msgid "Command-line interface"
msgstr "命令行界面"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/cli.rst:7
msgid ""
"The chemistry subpackage ships a small `Click "
"<https://click.palletsprojects.com/>`_-based command-line client for "
"downloading molecule data from `PubChem "
"<https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/>`_ without writing any Python. Run it "
"as a module:"
msgstr "化学子包附带一个基于 `Click <https://click.palletsprojects.com/>`_ 的小型命令行客户端，无需编写 Python 即可从 `PubChem <https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/>`_ 下载分子数据。以模块方式运行："

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/cli.rst:23
msgid ""
"``pubchem-molecule`` accepts a molecule identifier in four forms — "
"``--cid`` (PubChem compound ID), ``--name``, ``--smiles`` or ``--inchi`` "
"— each of which may be given multiple times to fetch several molecules in"
" a single request. ``--format`` selects the output file format (``sdf`` "
"by default, also ``asnt``, ``json`` or ``xml``), ``--three_d`` requests "
"three-dimensional coordinates, and ``--output_folder`` chooses where the "
"files are written."
msgstr "``pubchem-molecule`` 接受四种形式的分子标识符——``--cid``（PubChem 化合物 ID）、``--name``、``--smiles`` 或 ``--inchi``——每种都可以多次给出，以便一次请求获取多个分子。``--format`` 选择输出文件格式（默认 ``sdf``，也支持 ``asnt``、``json``、``xml``），``--three_d`` 请求三维坐标，``--output_folder`` 选择文件写入位置。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/cli.rst:32
msgid "Download by name"
msgstr "按名称下载"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/cli.rst:44
