#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"``manim-Chemistry`` is a chemistry visualisation toolkit for Manim. It "
"provides periodic-table elements, 2-D / 3-D molecule rendering, Bohr "
"atoms, orbital diagrams, and a PubChem API client for fetching molecular "
"data."
msgstr "``manim-Chemistry`` 是面向 Manim 的化学可视化工具包。它提供元素周期表、2D/3D 分子渲染、玻尔原子模型、轨道示意图，以及用于获取分子数据的 PubChem API 客户端。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.chemistry`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.chemistry`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:25
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.element.element.Element` – chemical "
"element data model (symbol, name, atomic number, mass, colour, etc.)."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.element.element.Element` – 化学元素数据模型（符号、名称、原子序数、质量、颜色等）。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:27
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.periodic_table.table_objects.PeriodicTable`"
" – full periodic-table layout as a Manim mobject."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.periodic_table.table_objects.PeriodicTable` – 以 Manim mobject 呈现的完整元素周期表布局。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:29
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.twoD.molecule.MMoleculeObject` – 2-D "
"molecule from a file or SMILES string."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.twoD.molecule.MMoleculeObject` – 从文件或 SMILES 字符串构建的 2D 分子。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:31
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.twoD.graph_molecule.GraphMolecule` – "
"graph-based molecule representation using ``networkx``."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.twoD.graph_molecule.GraphMolecule` – 基于 ``networkx`` 的图结构分子表示。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:33
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.threeD.threedmolecule.ThreeDMolecule`"
" – interactive 3-D molecule viewer."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.threeD.threedmolecule.ThreeDMolecule` – 交互式 3D 分子查看器。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:35
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.bohr_atom.bohr_atom.BohrAtom` – Bohr "
"atomic model animation."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.bohr_atom.bohr_atom.BohrAtom` – 玻尔原子模型动画。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:37
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.orbitals.orbitals.Orbital` – atomic "
"orbital visualisation."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.orbitals.orbitals.Orbital` – 原子轨道可视化。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:39
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.molecule.molecule.Molecule` – unified"
" facade that loads molecules from files, strings, or PubChem."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.molecule.molecule.Molecule` – 统一的门面类，可从文件、字符串或 PubChem 加载分子。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:41
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.utils.pubchem_api.PubchemAPIManager` "
"– PubChem REST API client."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.chemistry.utils.pubchem_api.PubchemAPIManager` – PubChem REST API 客户端。"

#: ../../source/reference/chemistry/index.rst:74
msgid ""
"The chemistry subpackage ships a small command-line client for "
"downloading molecule files from PubChem. See :doc:`cli` for the full "
"guide with examples of every option."
msgstr "化学子包附带一个小型命令行客户端，用于从 PubChem 下载分子文件。包含每个选项示例的完整指南见 :doc:`cli`。"

