":class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.PutCompassAway`,"
" :class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.DrawArc`."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.compass.compass.compass.Compass` mobject 与圆规动画：:class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.MoveNiddleTipTo`、:class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.RotateCompass`、:class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.SplitCompass`、:class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.PutCompass`、:class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.PutCompassAway`、:class:`~manim_extensions.compass.animations.animation_compass.DrawArc`。"

