"``sras_slope=None`` (default) — flat/horizontal Keynesian SRAS at "
"``sras_price``."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.economics.ad_as.ADASDiagram:9 of
msgid ""
"``sras_slope=<positive number>`` — upward-sloping SRAS using the Mankiw "
"formulation::"
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.economics.ad_as.ADASDiagram:14 of
msgid ""
"where *Pᵉ* is the expected price level (``sras_price``), *Ȳ* is potential"
" output (``lras_y``), and *slope* captures the cost structure "
"``(1−s)a/s``.  Shifts in SRAS correspond to changes in *Pᵉ*: when firms "
"revise expectations the curve shifts up/down while keeping the same "
"slope."
msgstr ""

