#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:6
msgid "GearBox"
msgstr "GearBox 齿轮"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:9
msgid "Vendoring status: manim-GearBox"
msgstr "内置状态：manim-GearBox"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:10
msgid "**Original author:** `GarryBGoode <https://github.com/GarryBGoode>`_"
msgstr "**原作者：** `GarryBGoode <https://github.com/GarryBGoode>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Source repository:** `GitHub <https://github.com/GarryBGoode/manim-"
"GearBox>`_"
msgstr "**源仓库：** `GitHub <https://github.com/GarryBGoode/manim-GearBox>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"``GearBox`` is a Manim plugin for drawing realistic involute gears and "
"mechanisms. The geometry is based on the `tec-science involute gear "
"article <https://www.tec-science.com/mechanical-power-transmission"
"/involute-gear/geometry-of-involute-gears/>`_."
msgstr "``GearBox`` 是用于绘制逼真渐开线齿轮与机构的 Manim 插件。其几何算法基于 `tec-science 的渐开线齿轮文章 <https://www.tec-science.com/mechanical-power-transmission/involute-gear/geometry-of-involute-gears/>`_。"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.gearbox`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.gearbox`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:26
msgid "Basic spur gears (:class:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.Gear`)"
msgstr "基本直齿轮（:class:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.Gear`）"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:27
msgid "Inside ring-gears (``inner_teeth=True``)"
msgstr "内齿圈（``inner_teeth=True``）"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:28
msgid "Basic rack (:class:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.Rack`)"
msgstr "基本齿条（:class:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.Rack`）"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:29
msgid "Undercutting for gears with fewer than 17 teeth"
msgstr "少于 17 齿齿轮的根切"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:30
msgid "Profile-shifted gears"
msgstr "变位齿轮"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"Meshing calculation with distance variation via "
":meth:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.Gear.mesh_to`"
msgstr "通过 :meth:`~manim_extensions.gearbox.Gear.mesh_to` 进行可变中心距的啮合计算"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"Because the module is included in ``manim_extensions``, you can import it"
" directly (``from manim_extensions.gearbox import *``). A common "
"rendering style is ``stroke_opacity=0`` and ``fill_opacity=1``, because "
"the stroke slightly enlarges the gear and can look like interference."
msgstr "由于该模块已包含在 ``manim_extensions`` 中，你可以直接导入（``from manim_extensions.gearbox import *``）。常用的渲染风格是 ``stroke_opacity=0`` 且 ``fill_opacity=1``，因为描边会略微放大齿轮，看起来像发生了干涉。"

#: ../../source/reference/gearbox/index.rst:94
msgid ""
"See the `original README <https://github.com/GarryBGoode/manim-GearBox>`_"
" for animated examples and further details."
msgstr "动画示例与更多细节见 `原始 README <https://github.com/GarryBGoode/manim-GearBox>`_。"

