#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:6
msgid "Meshes"
msgstr "网格"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:9
msgid "Vendoring status: manim-meshes"
msgstr "内置状态：manim-meshes"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Original author:** `Brizar <https://github.com/bmmtstb>`_ and `99Vicky "
"<https://github.com/99Vicky>`_"
msgstr "**原作者：** `Brizar <https://github.com/bmmtstb>`_ 和 `99Vicky <https://github.com/99Vicky>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:12
msgid "**Source repository:** `GitHub <https://github.com/bmmtstb/manim-meshes>`_"
msgstr "**源仓库：** `GitHub <https://github.com/bmmtstb/manim-meshes>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"``manim-meshes`` is a geometry and mesh toolkit for Manim. It focuses on "
"rendering polygonal and triangular structures, especially for educational"
" visualisations of geometry, triangulation, and topology."
msgstr "``manim-meshes`` 是面向 Manim 的几何与网格工具包，专注于渲染多边形与三角结构，尤其适合几何、三角剖分和拓扑的教学可视化。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.meshes`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.meshes`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:26
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` data model"
" for mesh topology and operations."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` 数据模型，用于网格拓扑与操作。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:27
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.basic_mesh.ManimMesh`"
" / "
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.basic_mesh.Manim2DMesh`"
" for mesh rendering."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.basic_mesh.ManimMesh` / :class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.basic_mesh.Manim2DMesh`，用于网格渲染。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:28
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.triangle_mesh.TriangleManim2DMesh`"
" for triangle-based geometric structures."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.triangle_mesh.TriangleManim2DMesh`，用于基于三角形的几何结构。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:29
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.opengl_mesh.FastManimMesh`"
" for faster scene rendering when available."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.opengl_mesh.FastManimMesh`，在可用时加速场景渲染。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:30
msgid "Delaunay and Voronoi-related tooling in the bundled mesh utilities."
msgstr "内置网格工具中的 Delaunay 与 Voronoi 相关功能。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:35
msgid "Import the package directly from the vendored namespace:"
msgstr "直接从内置于本包的命名空间导入："

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:38
msgid "Building a mesh structure"
msgstr "构建网格结构"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"The low-level "
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` is a pure "
"data model: pass an array-like list of *vertices* and a list of *faces* "
"(referencing vertex indices), and it validates the structure and lets you"
" inspect or combine meshes before rendering."
msgstr "底层的 :class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` 是纯数据模型：传入类数组的*顶点*列表和*面*列表（引用顶点索引），它会校验结构，并允许你在渲染前检查或合并网格。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:47
msgid ""
"The manim-side renderers "
"(:class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.basic_mesh.ManimMesh`"
" and the 2D / triangle / OpenGL variants) require the optional ``colour``"
" and ``moderngl`` dependencies.  When those are not installed, the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` data model"
" is still fully importable and usable for computing mesh structures."
msgstr "Manim 侧的渲染器（:class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.manim_models.basic_mesh.ManimMesh` 及 2D/三角/OpenGL 变体）需要可选依赖 ``colour`` 和 ``moderngl``。未安装这些依赖时，:class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` 数据模型仍可完整导入并用于网格结构计算。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:52
msgid "This package is most appropriate for:"
msgstr "本包最适用于："

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:54
msgid "geometry lessons,"
msgstr "几何课程，"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:55
msgid "mesh and triangulation demonstrations,"
msgstr "网格与三角剖分演示，"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:56
msgid "topology and connected-structure visualisations."
msgstr "拓扑与连通结构可视化。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/index.rst:58
msgid ""
"See the `original project page <https://github.com/bmmtstb/manim-"
"meshes>`_ for details on the mesh model and more advanced examples."
msgstr "网格模型的细节与更多进阶示例见 `原始项目页面 <https://github.com/bmmtstb/manim-meshes>`_。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/mobjects.rst:6
