":class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` data model"
" into on-screen Manim mobjects."
msgstr "本页介绍 Manim 侧的网格渲染器，它们把 :class:`~manim_extensions.meshes.models.data_models.mesh.Mesh` 数据模型变成屏幕上的 Manim mobject。"

#: ../../source/reference/meshes/mobjects.rst:14
msgid ""
"The manim-side renderers depend on the optional ``colour`` / ``moderngl``"
" packages and are therefore not importable in every environment."
msgstr "Manim 侧的渲染器依赖可选的 ``colour`` / ``moderngl`` 包，因此并非在所有环境中都能导入。"

