"physical constraint such as a spring or hinge."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.pymunk.constraints.VDampedRotarySpring.VDampedRotarySpring:10
#: of
msgid ""
"The equilibrium angle (in radians). The target angle between the two "
"objects when the system is at rest and no external forces are applied."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.pymunk.constraints.VDampedRotarySpring.VDampedRotarySpring:12
#: of
msgid ""
"The spring constant (elasticity). A higher value increases the "
"restorative force toward the ``rest_angle``, making the spring feel "
"stiffer."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.pymunk.constraints.VDampedRotarySpring.VDampedRotarySpring:14
#: of
msgid ""
"The damping coefficient. Used to simulate energy dissipation (like "
"friction or air resistance). Higher values cause oscillations to decay "
"faster."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.pymunk.constraints.VDampedRotarySpring.VDampedRotarySpring:16
