#: ../../source/reference/pymunk/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"``manim-pymunk`` integrates the `Pymunk <http://www.pymunk.org>`_ 2-D "
"physics engine with Manim. It provides a physics "
":class:`~manim_extensions.physics.rigid_mechanics.rigid_mechanics.Space` "
"mobject, a dedicated "
":class:`~manim_extensions.physics.rigid_mechanics.rigid_mechanics.SpaceScene`"
" with step-simulation support, and a collection of visual constraint and "
"mobject classes (springs, pin joints, gears, etc.)."
msgstr "``manim-pymunk`` 将 `Pymunk <http://www.pymunk.org>`_ 2D 物理引擎与 Manim 集成。它提供物理 :class:`~manim_extensions.physics.rigid_mechanics.rigid_mechanics.Space` mobject、支持步进模拟的专用 :class:`~manim_extensions.physics.rigid_mechanics.rigid_mechanics.SpaceScene`，以及一组可视化约束与 mobject 类（弹簧、销关节、齿轮等）。"

#: ../../source/reference/pymunk/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.pymunk`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.pymunk`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/pymunk/index.rst:26
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.pymunk.space.SpaceScene.SpaceScene` – a "
":class:`~manim.scene.zoomed_scene.ZoomedScene` subclass that steps the "
"physics engine on each frame."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.pymunk.space.SpaceScene.SpaceScene` – 每帧步进物理引擎的 :class:`~manim.scene.zoomed_scene.ZoomedScene` 子类。"

#: ../../source/reference/pymunk/index.rst:29
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.pymunk.space.VSpace.VSpace` – the physics space"
" mobject that holds bodies, shapes, and constraints."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.pymunk.space.VSpace.VSpace` – 容纳刚体、形状与约束的物理空间 mobject。"

