#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:6
msgid "Rubik's Cube"
msgstr "魔方"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:9
msgid "Vendoring status: manim-rubikscube"
msgstr "内置状态：manim-rubikscube"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:10
msgid "**Original author:** `KingWampy <https://github.com/WampyCakes>`_"
msgstr "**原作者：** `KingWampy <https://github.com/WampyCakes>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Source repository:** `GitHub <https://github.com/WampyCakes/manim-"
"rubikscube>`_"
msgstr "**源仓库：** `GitHub <https://github.com/WampyCakes/manim-rubikscube>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"``manim-rubikscube`` is a Manim implementation of the classic Rubik's "
"Cube. It is designed for puzzle demonstrations, cube-state tutorials, and"
" move-by-move explanations inside scene code."
msgstr "``manim-rubikscube`` 是经典魔方的 Manim 实现，适用于在场景代码中做魔方演示、魔方状态教程和逐转动讲解。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.rubikscube`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.rubikscube`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:26
msgid ":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` main cube model."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 主魔方模型。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:27
msgid "cubie-based state and face logic."
msgstr "基于小方块（cubie）的状态与面逻辑。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:28
msgid "move- and rotation-related animation helpers."
msgstr "转动与旋转相关的动画辅助工具。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:29
msgid "puzzle-style demos for teaching algorithms and turns."
msgstr "用于讲解还原算法与转动的益智演示。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:30
msgid "easy integration into Manim scenes as a standard mobject."
msgstr "作为标准 mobject 轻松集成到 Manim 场景中。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:33
msgid "Creating a RubiksCube"
msgstr "创建 RubiksCube"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:35
msgid ""
"After creating the :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`,"
" it may be necessary to scale it to comfortably see the cube in the "
"camera's frame."
msgstr "创建 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 之后，可能需要缩放它，以便在相机取景范围内舒适地看到魔方。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:57
msgid "Changing the colors of a RubiksCube"
msgstr "修改 RubiksCube 的颜色"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:59
msgid ""
"The ``colors`` parameter accepts a list of six colours in the order "
"``[Up, Right, Front, Down, Left, Back]``. The default is ``[WHITE, "
"\"#B90000\", \"#009B48\", \"#FFD500\", \"#FF5900\", \"#0045AD\"]``."
msgstr "``colors`` 参数接受按 ``[Up, Right, Front, Down, Left, Back]`` 顺序排列的六个颜色的列表。默认值为 ``[WHITE, \"#B90000\", \"#009B48\", \"#FFD500\", \"#FF5900\", \"#0045AD\"]``。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:82
msgid "Setting the state of a RubiksCube"
msgstr "设置 RubiksCube 的状态"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:84
msgid ""
"When you have a RubiksCube in real life and want to replicate it in "
"manim, the :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state`"
" method enables this functionality. Or, if you know the state of any cube"
" without knowing what movements got it to that point, this method allows "
"you to also replicate that."
msgstr "当你手中有一个真实的魔方并想在 Manim 中复现它时，:meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` 方法可以实现这一点。或者，如果你知道某个魔方的状态但不知道它是如何转到这个状态的，也可以用这个方法复现。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:89
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` method"
" takes in a string that tells the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` what color each "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` should be. Imagine that"
" you have a RubiksCube that is flattened to 2D as below:"
msgstr ":meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` 方法接受一个字符串，告诉 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 每个 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 应该是什么颜色。想象把一个魔方展开成如下所示的 2D 形式："

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:117
msgid ""
"In order to tell "
":meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` what color"
" the U1 cubie should be, you tell it which face's color that is."
msgstr "为了告诉 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` U1 小方块应该是什么颜色，你只需告诉它那是哪个面的颜色。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:120
msgid ""
"For example, if the R face of the Cube is pink and U1 is pink, the first "
"letter in the string is ``R``."
msgstr "例如，如果魔方的 R 面是粉色，而 U1 是粉色，那么字符串的第一个字母就是 ``R``。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:123
msgid ""
"Similarly, because the center of the U face (U5) does not change color, "
"it will be the letter ``U`` in the state string (for the U face, that "
"would mean the 5th letter in the string)."
msgstr "类似地，由于 U 面中心（U5）不会变色，它在状态字符串中就是字母 ``U`` （对 U 面而言，即字符串的第 5 个字母）。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:127
msgid ""
"Starting at the number 1 cubie and working to the number 9 cubie, the "
"order of the state string is the U face, then R face, followed by F, D, "
"L, B, in that order."
msgstr "从 1 号小方块到 9 号小方块，状态字符串的顺序依次是 U 面、R 面，然后是 F、D、L、B 面。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:131
msgid ""
"So, the first 9 letters in the string below tell the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` what color each "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` in the U face is. So on"
" and so forth for the other sides."
msgstr "因此，下面字符串的前 9 个字母告诉 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` U 面每个 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 的颜色。其余各面依此类推。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:135
msgid ""
"This method works for a cube of any dimensions, as long as a color is "
"provided for each :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` face."
msgstr "只要为每个 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 面都提供了颜色，这个方法适用于任意阶数的魔方。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:159
msgid "Properties of a RubiksCube"
msgstr "RubiksCube 的属性"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:161
msgid ""
"Note: It is not necessary to pass any parameters to the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`. Doing so is "
"entirely for additional functionality and stylistic tweaks."
msgstr "注意：不必向 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 传入任何参数，传参完全是为了额外的功能和样式微调。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:164
msgid ""
"To this point, we have seen that one property of a "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` is a list of colors"
" for the cube faces. There are currently two other parameters that can be"
" passed."
msgstr "到目前为止，我们已经看到 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 的一个属性是各面颜色的列表。目前还可以传入另外两个参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:169
msgid "Dimension"
msgstr "阶数（Dimension）"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:190
msgid ""
"An example of "
":meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` on a "
"non-3-dimensional cube:"
msgstr "在非 3 阶魔方上使用 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` 的示例："

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:213
msgid "10-Dimensional RubiksCube"
msgstr "10 阶 RubiksCube"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:217
msgid ""
"While this plugin can create a RubiksCube with large dimensions, it takes"
" a long time to render. In the future, OpenGL rendering will vastly "
"improve this."
msgstr "虽然这个插件可以创建高阶魔方，但渲染耗时很长。未来 OpenGL 渲染将大幅改善这一点。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:236
msgid "Offset"
msgstr "偏移（Offset）"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:238
msgid ""
"A :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` has three "
"different offset values. Offsets can be useful for isolating faces or "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` objects for further "
"explanation or analysis."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 有三个不同的偏移值。偏移可用于把某些面或 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 对象分离出来，便于进一步讲解或分析。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:242
msgid "The ``x_offset`` determines how close/far Cubies are from Front to Back"
msgstr "``x_offset`` 决定小方块从前到后的间距"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:244
msgid "The ``y_offset`` determines how close/far Cubies are from Right to Left"
msgstr "``y_offset`` 决定小方块从右到左的间距"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:246
msgid "The ``z_offset`` determines how close/far Cubies are from Top to Bottom"
msgstr "``z_offset`` 决定小方块从上到下的间距"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:248
msgid ""
"The default value for all three offsets is ``2.1``. Adjusting these "
"offsets changes the \"gap\" between Cubies."
msgstr "三个偏移的默认值都是 ``2.1``。调整这些偏移会改变小方块之间的“缝隙”。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:290
msgid "Accessing Faces and Cubies"
msgstr "访问面与小方块"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:293
msgid "Accessing a Cubie"
msgstr "访问单个小方块"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:295
msgid ""
"A :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` is each individual "
"cube in a :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`. For a "
"3x3x3 RubiksCube, there are 27 cubies. The cube's cubies are stored in a "
"numpy array called "
":attr:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.cubies`."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 是 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 中的每个小方块。3x3x3 魔方有 27 个小方块，它们存储在名为 :attr:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.cubies` 的 numpy 数组中。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:299
msgid ""
"For a 3-dimensional "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`, the "
":attr:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.cubies` array is "
"structured as follows:"
msgstr "对于 3 阶 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`，:attr:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.cubies` 数组的结构如下："

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:323
msgid ""
"Each \"level\" in the array represents a coordinate. Each of the first "
"three arrays represents a different X value (0, 1, or 2). In each of "
"those arrays, there are three more arrays, each representing a different "
"Y value (0, 1, or 2). Finally, there are three "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` objects. Each "
"represents a different Z value. The size of this array directly "
"corresponds to the dimension of the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`. This structure, "
"along with numpy, allows for easy, convenient, and cheap accessing of "
"cubies and faces."
msgstr "数组的每一“层”代表一个坐标。最外层三个数组各代表一个不同的 X 值（0、1 或 2）。其中每个数组里又有三个数组，各代表一个不同的 Y 值（0、1 或 2）。最里层是三个 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 对象，各代表一个不同的 Z 值。数组的大小直接对应 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 的阶数。这种结构配合 numpy，可以简单、方便、高效地访问小方块和面。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:331
msgid ""
"For Reference: If facing the Rubik's Cube, X goes Front to Back, Y goes "
"Right to Left, Z goes Down to Up. Each coordinate starts at 0 and goes to"
" ``(Dimension - 1)``."
msgstr "参考：面向魔方时，X 轴由前向后，Y 轴由右向左，Z 轴由下向上。每个坐标从 0 到 ``(Dimension - 1)``。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:335
msgid ""
"So, to access the :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` at "
"coordinates X=0, Y=0, Z=0, ``cube.cubies[0, 0, 0]`` will return it. This "
"holds true no matter the dimension of the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`."
msgstr "因此，要访问坐标 X=0、Y=0、Z=0 处的 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie`，用 ``cube.cubies[0, 0, 0]`` 即可。无论 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 是多少阶，这都成立。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:363
msgid "Accessing a Face"
msgstr "访问一个面"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:365
msgid ""
"The :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` has a method "
"called :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.get_face` that"
" will return an array of "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` objects. At its core, "
"this just accesses Cubies like we did above."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 有一个 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.get_face` 方法，返回一个 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 对象数组。其本质就是像上面那样访问小方块。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:369
msgid ""
"Because the front face of the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` has an X value of 0"
" (regardless of the dimension of the cube), returning all Cubies with an "
"X value of 0 will give you the front face. When ``cube.get_face(\"F\")`` "
"is called, it is effectively returning ``cube.cubies[0, :, :]``. This is "
"possible for all 6 faces of the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`, and it can also be"
" used manually to return more than just one \"slice\" of a "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` at a time. This is "
"achievable with numpy indexing."
msgstr "由于 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 正面的 X 值为 0（与魔方阶数无关），返回所有 X 值为 0 的小方块就得到了正面。调用 ``cube.get_face(\"F\")`` 实际上等同于返回 ``cube.cubies[0, :, :]``。:class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 的全部 6 个面都可以这样做；借助 numpy 索引，你还可以手动一次返回 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 的多个“切片”。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:402
msgid "Accessing a Cubie Face"
msgstr "访问小方块的面"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:404
msgid ""
"Just as the :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.get_face`"
" method works, once you have accessed a "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` object, you can call "
":meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie.get_face`. For example, "
"calling ``cube.cubies[0, 0, 0].get_face(\"F\")`` will return the front "
"face of that cubie as a :class:`~manim.mobject.geometry.polygram.Square` "
"mobject. If the :meth:`~manim.mobject.geometry.polygram.Square` method "
"returns a different square than you expected, it is likely a result of "
"the :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube`'s or the "
"camera's orientation changing your perspective of direction in the scene."
msgstr "与 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.get_face` 方法类似，访问到 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie` 对象后，你可以调用 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cubie.Cubie.get_face`。例如，``cube.cubies[0, 0, 0].get_face(\"F\")`` 会以 :class:`~manim.mobject.geometry.polygram.Square` mobject 的形式返回该小方块的前面。如果 :meth:`~manim.mobject.geometry.polygram.Square` 方法返回的方块与预期不同，很可能是 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 或相机的朝向改变了你在场景中的方向感。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:413
msgid "Face Rotations"
msgstr "面的旋转"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:415
msgid ""
"The recommended way to rotate a face of the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` is to use the "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube_animations.CubeMove` animation."
" I highly discourage trying to rotate the cube without using this pre-"
"made animation. While possible, it's not worth it."
msgstr "旋转 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 某个面的推荐方式是使用 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube_animations.CubeMove` 动画。强烈建议不要绕过这个现成动画去手动旋转魔方——虽然可行，但不值得。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:420
msgid "CubeMove animation"
msgstr "CubeMove 动画"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:447
msgid "Solving the Cube"
msgstr "还原魔方"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:449
msgid ""
"This implementation of a "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` also includes "
"Kociemba's algorithm, a brilliantly fast solving algorithm made by "
"Herbert Kociemba. The "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` object includes the"
" method "
":meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.solve_by_kociemba`. "
"Given a state, it will return a list of moves to perform. Solving is only"
" possible for 3-dimensional cubes. Solving any other size "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` will require "
"hardcoding of the moves to perform. Currently, "
":meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.solve_by_kociemba` "
"requires a state string to solve (like the one used in "
":meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state`). In the "
"future, this will be replaced with using the state of the cube without "
"having to manually input the state of the cube."
msgstr "这个 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 实现还包含了 Kociemba 算法——Herbert Kociemba 提出的极快的还原算法。:class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 对象提供 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.solve_by_kociemba` 方法，给定一个状态，它会返回需要执行的转动列表。只有 3 阶魔方可以求解，其他阶数的 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube` 需要硬编码转动步骤。目前 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.solve_by_kociemba` 需要一个状态字符串（与 :meth:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube.RubiksCube.set_state` 所用的相同）来求解。未来会改为直接使用魔方自身的状态，无需手动输入。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:460
msgid ""
"Given the state of the Cube, it returned the necessary moves to execute "
"to solve it. All moves returned by the method are able to be read by "
":class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube_animations.CubeMove`."
msgstr "给定魔方的状态，它返回了还原所需的转动。该方法返回的所有转动都可以被 :class:`~manim_extensions.rubikscube.cube_animations.CubeMove` 读取。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:465
msgid "Putting it All Together"
msgstr "综合运用"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:492
msgid "This package is especially useful for:"
msgstr "本包尤其适用于："

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:494
msgid "cubing tutorials,"
msgstr "魔方教程，"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:495
msgid "algorithm explanations for cube solving,"
msgstr "魔方还原算法讲解，"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:496
msgid "puzzle-state visualisations in lecture material."
msgstr "课件中的谜题状态可视化。"

#: ../../source/reference/rubikscube/index.rst:498
msgid ""
"See the `original project <https://github.com/WampyCakes/manim-"
"rubikscube>`_ for the full spec, examples, and documentation."
msgstr "完整的规格说明、示例与文档见 `原始项目 <https://github.com/WampyCakes/manim-rubikscube>`_。"

