#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:10
msgid "**Original author:** `Thomas Chen <https://github.com/foxnewsnetwork>`_"
msgstr "**原作者：** `Thomas Chen <https://github.com/foxnewsnetwork>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:12
