#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"``manim-sequence-diagram`` adds UML-like sequence-diagram primitives to "
"Manim. It is meant for software architecture explanations, API flow "
"demos, and message-order visualisations."
msgstr "``manim-sequence-diagram`` 为 Manim 添加了类 UML 的时序图图元，适用于软件架构讲解、API 流程演示和消息时序可视化。"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.sequence_diagram`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.sequence_diagram`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:26
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.sequence_diagram.seq_actor.SeqActor` – "
"participant or lifeline object."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.sequence_diagram.seq_actor.SeqActor` – 参与者或生命线对象。"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:27
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.sequence_diagram.seq_object.SeqObject` – object"
" or system boundary in the sequence."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.sequence_diagram.seq_object.SeqObject` – 时序中的对象或系统边界。"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:28
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.sequence_diagram.seq_action.SeqAction` – action"
" or message entry in the timeline."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.sequence_diagram.seq_action.SeqAction` – 时间线中的动作或消息条目。"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:29
msgid "simple composition for actor-to-actor communication flows."
msgstr "用于参与者之间通信流程的简单组合。"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:30
msgid "diagrams for software engineering and protocol explanations."
msgstr "用于软件工程与协议讲解的示意图。"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:49
msgid "This library is especially useful when explaining:"
msgstr "本库在讲解以下内容时尤其有用："

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:51
msgid "API request / response flows,"
msgstr "API 请求/响应流程，"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:52
msgid "lifecycle and event sequences,"
msgstr "生命周期与事件序列，"

#: ../../source/reference/sequence_diagram/index.rst:53
