#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject:1 of
msgid "Wrap a VMobject and stream its rendered SVG into an HTML page."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject:3 of
msgid ""
"While the scene runs, the vmobject is continuously exported to an SVG "
"file and the corresponding JavaScript/SVG updates are injected into a "
"generated HTML page, so the object can be viewed and interacted with in a"
" web browser."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject:8 of
msgid "The Manim object to export and animate in the HTML output."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject:10
#: of
msgid ""
"The scene in which ``vmobject`` lives. Its camera state and background "
"color are used for the HTML output, and the per-frame updater is "
"registered on it."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject:14
#: of
msgid ""
"Width of the embedded SVG element, e.g. ``\"500px\"``. Defaults to "
"``\"500px\"``."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject:17
#: of
msgid ""
"If ``True``, generate a minimal HTML wrapper without the full page "
"structure and script tag. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject:23
#: of
msgid ""
"Render the scene with the ``--disable_caching`` flag. Besides the MP4, an"
" HTML and a JS file are written next to the scene file; open the HTML "
"file in a browser and call ``renderHTMLParsedVMobjectDocExample()`` from "
"the developer console to see the SVG animation."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.updater:1
#: of
msgid "Export the vmobject to an SVG frame and append the JS update."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.updater:3
#: of
msgid ""
"Called once per rendered frame through the scene updater registered in "
"``__init__``: serializes ``self.vmobject`` via ``to_svg()``, converts the"
" resulting path attributes into JavaScript DOM update statements and "
"appends them to ``self.js_updates``."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.updater:8
#: of
msgid "Elapsed time since the previous frame, in seconds."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.update_html:1
#: of
msgid "Rewrite the HTML page with the current frame and time."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.update_html:3
#: of
msgid ""
"Called on every scene update; embeds the current SVG frame and renderer "
"time into the HTML/JS output."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.finish:1
#: of
msgid "Stop the updater and write the final HTML and JS files."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.finish:3
#: of
msgid ""
"Removes the scene updater and flushes the accumulated JavaScript updates "
"to ``<scene_name>.js`` and the final page to ``<scene_name>.html``."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.start_interactive:1
#: of
msgid "Precompute the interactive JavaScript state for value combinations."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.start_interactive:3
#: of
msgid ""
"Iterates over the cartesian product of ``linspaces``, sets each "
"combination on ``value_trackers``, exports the vmobject once per "
"combination and records the resulting JavaScript DOM updates, so the "
"generated HTML page can switch between the states interactively."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.start_interactive:8
#: of
msgid "Value trackers, swept through every combination of ``linspaces``."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.start_interactive:11
#: of
msgid ""
"Arrays of values to sweep, one per entry of ``value_trackers``. Their "
"cartesian product is enumerated."
msgstr ""

#: manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject.start_interactive:14
#: of
msgid ""
"If ``False``, stop the per-frame updater before sweeping and record the "
"current scene time as ``self.last_t``. Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:5
msgid "SVG Animations"
msgstr "SVG 动画"

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:8
msgid "Vendoring status: manim-svg-animations"
msgstr "内置状态：manim-svg-animations"

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:9
msgid "**Original author:** `MathLike <https://github.com/MathItYT>`_"
msgstr "**原作者：** `MathLike <https://github.com/MathItYT>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Source repository:** `GitHub <https://github.com/MathItYT/manim-svg-"
"animations>`_"
msgstr "**源仓库：** `GitHub <https://github.com/MathItYT/manim-svg-animations>`_"

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"``manim-svg-animations`` exports Manim scenes as interactive HTML + SVG +"
" JavaScript animations. It converts each frame's mobjects to SVG paths "
"and generates an HTML file with JavaScript that replays the animation in "
"a browser."
msgstr "``manim-svg-animations`` 将 Manim 场景导出为交互式 HTML + SVG + JavaScript 动画。它把每一帧的 mobject 转换为 SVG 路径，并生成带有 JavaScript 的 HTML 文件，在浏览器中回放动画。"

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.svg_animations`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.svg_animations`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"This module requires the ``manim-mobject-svg`` plugin (it provides "
":attr:`~manim.mobject.types.vectorized_mobject.VMobject.to_svg()`). On "
"Python 3.13+ install it with ``pip install --ignore-requires-python "
"manim-mobject-svg``."
msgstr "本模块需要 ``manim-mobject-svg`` 插件（它提供 :attr:`~manim.mobject.types.vectorized_mobject.VMobject.to_svg()`）。在 Python 3.13+ 上使用 ``pip install --ignore-requires-python manim-mobject-svg`` 安装。"

#: ../../source/reference/svg_animations/index.rst:32
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject`"
" – converts a :class:`~manim.mobject.types.vectorized_mobject.VMobject` "
"into an SVG-based HTML animation. Attaches to a scene as an updater, "
"writes per-frame SVG paths, and produces a finished ``.html`` + ``.js`` "
"pair on ``finish()``."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.svg_animations.html_parsed_vmobject.HTMLParsedVMobject` – 将 :class:`~manim.mobject.types.vectorized_mobject.VMobject` 转换为基于 SVG 的 HTML 动画。它以 updater 的形式挂到场景上，逐帧写出 SVG 路径，并在 ``finish()`` 时生成最终的 ``.html`` + ``.js`` 文件对。"

