#: ../../source/reference/table/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"``manim-table`` is a database-style table animation extension for Manim "
"Community Edition. It supports animated row/column insertion and "
"deletion, cell value updates, resizing, and styling."
msgstr "``manim-table`` 是面向 Manim 社区版的数据库风格表格动画扩展，支持带动画的行/列插入与删除、单元格值更新、调整大小和样式设置。"

#: ../../source/reference/table/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.table`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.table`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/table/index.rst:25
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.table.table.Table` – the main table mobject. "
"Construct from a list of rows or from separate header + data rows."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.table.table.Table` – 主表格 mobject。可由行列表构建，也可由表头加数据行分别构建。"

#: ../../source/reference/table/index.rst:27
msgid ":class:`~manim_extensions.table.row.Row` – a single table row."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.table.row.Row` – 单个表格行。"

#: ../../source/reference/table/index.rst:28
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.table.cell.Cell` – a single table cell with "
"border, background, and text."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.table.cell.Cell` – 带边框、背景和文本的单个单元格。"

