#: ../../source/reference/tikz/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"``manim-tikz`` converts TikZ markup into Manim-compatible SVG objects so "
"that existing LaTeX/TikZ diagrams can be reused in a scene without "
"manually rebuilding all shapes in Python."
msgstr "``manim-tikz`` 将 TikZ 标记转换为 Manim 兼容的 SVG 对象，让现有的 LaTeX/TikZ 图形可以直接在场景中复用，无需用 Python 手工重建所有形状。"

#: ../../source/reference/tikz/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"The code is bundled inside ``manim_extensions`` as the "
"``manim_extensions.tikz`` subpackage."
msgstr "代码以 ``manim_extensions.tikz`` 子包的形式内置在 ``manim_extensions`` 中。"

#: ../../source/reference/tikz/index.rst:26
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.tikz.tikz.Tikz` wrapper for converting TikZ "
"code into an :class:`~manim.mobject.svg.svg_mobject.SVGMobject`."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.tikz.tikz.Tikz` 包装类，用于将 TikZ 代码转换为 :class:`~manim.mobject.svg.svg_mobject.SVGMobject`。"

#: ../../source/reference/tikz/index.rst:27
msgid ""
":class:`~manim_extensions.tikz.template.TikzTemplate` support for "
"reusable LaTeX/TikZ templates."
msgstr ":class:`~manim_extensions.tikz.template.TikzTemplate`，支持可复用的 LaTeX/TikZ 模板。"

#: ../../source/reference/tikz/index.rst:28
msgid "integration for drawings that already exist in TikZ format."
msgstr "对已有 TikZ 格式图形的集成。"

#: ../../source/reference/tikz/index.rst:29
msgid "suitable for academic slides and diagram-heavy explanatory scenes."
msgstr "适合学术幻灯片和图形密集的讲解场景。"

#: ../../source/reference/tikz/index.rst:45
