#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:5
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:8
msgid "Do I need to install LaTeX?"
msgstr "我需要安装 LaTeX 吗？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:10
msgid ""
"Only if you want to use "
":class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex`. For English-only "
"formulas, Manim's default :class:`~manim.MathTex` works without "
"additional LaTeX packages."
msgstr "只有当你想使用 :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex` 时才需要。对于纯英文公式，Manim 默认的 :class:`~manim.MathTex` 无需额外的 LaTeX 宏包即可使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:15
msgid "Which Python versions are supported?"
msgstr "支持哪些 Python 版本？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:17
msgid "``manim_extensions`` supports Python 3.11 through 3.14."
msgstr "``manim_extensions`` 支持 Python 3.11 至 3.14。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:20
msgid "Can I use the bundled plugins without installing ``manim_extensions``?"
msgstr "不安装 ``manim_extensions`` 可以使用内置插件吗？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:22
msgid ""
"Yes. The plugins are also available from their original repositories and "
"are kept as subpackages within ``manim_extensions``. However, installing "
"``manim_extensions`` lets you import them directly from the package "
"namespace and guarantees compatible versions."
msgstr "可以。这些插件也可以从它们各自的原始仓库获取，在 ``manim_extensions`` 中以子包形式保留。不过，安装 ``manim_extensions`` 可以让你直接从包命名空间导入它们，并保证版本兼容。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:28
msgid "Why does my example render as a still image instead of a video?"
msgstr "为什么我的示例渲染成了静态图片而不是视频？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:30
msgid ""
"The ``.. manim::`` directive renders a video by default. If you add the "
"``:save_last_frame:`` option, it renders only the last frame as an image."
" Use that option for static scenes and omit it for animations."
msgstr "``.. manim::`` 指令默认渲染视频。如果添加了 ``:save_last_frame:`` 选项，则只将最后一帧渲染为图片。静态场景使用该选项，动画则省略它。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:35
msgid "How do I report a bug or request a feature?"
msgstr "如何报告 bug 或提出功能请求？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/faq.rst:37
msgid ""
"Open an issue on the `GitHub repository "
"<https://github.com/ExploreMaths/manim_extensions/issues>`_."
msgstr "在 `GitHub 仓库 <https://github.com/ExploreMaths/manim_extensions/issues>`_ 上提交 issue。"

