#: ../../source/tutorials/quickstart.rst:5
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quickstart.rst:7
msgid ""
"This guide walks through the main parts of ``manim_extensions`` and shows"
" how to use them in a Manim scene."
msgstr "本指南将介绍 ``manim_extensions`` 的主要部分，并演示如何在 Manim 场景中使用它们。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quickstart.rst:19
msgid ""
"The only runtime dependencies are `manim "
"<https://pypi.org/project/manim/>`_ and `numpy "
"<https://pypi.org/project/numpy/>`_. Module-specific dependencies are "
"optional extras — install everything at once with ``pip install "
"manim_extensions[all]`` or pick per-module extras, see "
":doc:`../installation/index`."
msgstr "运行时依赖只有 `manim <https://pypi.org/project/manim/>`_ 和 `numpy <https://pypi.org/project/numpy/>`_。模块专属依赖是可选 extras——可以用 ``pip install manim_extensions[all]`` 一次全部安装，也可以按模块选择安装，见 :doc:`../installation/index`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quickstart.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you want to use :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex`, "
"make sure ``xelatex`` and the ``xeCJK`` LaTeX package are available on "
"your system."
msgstr "如果你想使用 :class:`~manim_extensions.mobjects.ChineseMathTex`，请确保系统中有 ``xelatex`` 和 ``xeCJK`` LaTeX 宏包。"

